- Recover a released round after an old input is paid out
  The wallet checks that the server released the participation before
  canceling a pending round whose input has an expiry payout decision. It
  asks about its inputs right before it sends its forfeits, and never
  cancels a round whose forfeits may have gone out: like upstream after its
  fix for withheld preimages, it keeps the round until the server releases
  it.
  [#8](https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/scuttle/pull/8)
